  "雾港保存着十二份千早诺亚的入境记录，每一份衣着、行李与日期不同，每一枚指纹却都能通过检验。寄宿学校又留下十三张互不相同的入学照片；其中最晚一张把她和事务所的空椅拍在一起。她不是失踪者。她先于委托找上门，只要求我们在第十三次抵达以前证明：矛盾并不自动等于撒谎。": "Mist Harbour keeps twelve entry records for Chihaya Noa — the clothes, baggage and dates all differ, yet every fingerprint passes inspection. The boarding school holds thirteen enrolment photographs, no two alike; the latest even captures her with the agency's empty chair. She is no missing person. She came to us ahead of any commission, asking only that we prove, before the thirteenth arrival, that contradiction does not automatically equal a lie.",
