  "05:07 — 她们各自离开，只约定不把另一位交给警方。": "05:07 — They each leave, agreeing only not to hand the other to the police.",
  "列车送来的诺亚握着裁纸刀，同行的诺亚先认出了刀柄上的纸结。她们对昨夜的记忆相反，却都能沿自己的折法走出一条完整路线。叠合地图显示，城市至少被局部改写过十二次；旧路没有消失，只是被挤到纸张无法承认的背面。我们没有替她们挑选谁跟随调查。两个人都保留行动权，也都在独立检查我们。": "The Noa the train brought held a paper knife; the Noa beside her recognised the knot on its handle first. Their memories of last night are opposite, yet each can walk a complete route by her own folding. The overlaid maps show the city has been partly rewritten at least twelve times; the old roads did not vanish, only got pushed to the side of the paper it cannot admit. We did not choose for them which would follow the investigation. Both keep their freedom to act, and both are examining us in turn.",
  "如果其中一位只是复制品，她为什么拥有另一位从未经历、却能被地图验证的连续路线？": "If one of them is only a copy, why does she own a continuous route the other never lived yet the map can verify?",
