  "03:41 — 年轻编目员交出一张通往未成线的站台图。": "03:41 — A young cataloguer hands over a platform plan leading to the unmade line.",
  "05:11 — 镜片库熄灯，十三个方向的脚步声仍没有停止。": "05:11 — The lens vault goes dark, yet footsteps in thirteen directions do not stop.",
  "终灯会没有理解千早家的返镜仪式，只学会把铜镜、时刻表和城市线路叠在一起。他们把被掠器物抹去来路，再让一个日本学生替虚构的“东方神秘”背书。返照镜碎片保存的不是预言，而是一段已经生活过的可能记忆；地下图纸则证明，学会一直把被重置的人送往一条未成线路。错误的知识并未让仪式失效，只让它失去任何伦理边界。": "The Afterlight Society never understood the Chihaya family's mirror ritual; it only learned to stack a bronze mirror, a timetable and the city's lines together. They stripped looted objects of their provenance, then had a Japanese student endorse an invented 'Oriental mystery'. The reflecting-mirror shard keeps not a prophecy but a possible memory already lived; the underground plans prove the society has long sent reset people down an unmade line. Mistaken knowledge did not make the ritual fail — it only stripped it of any ethical limit.",
  "一套被严重错译的仪式为什么仍能稳定留下十二段完整人生？": "Why does a badly mistranslated ritual still reliably leave behind twelve complete lives?",
  "未成线的十二个地址": "The Twelve Addresses of the Unmade Line",
  "被删除的城市版本里，每一位诺亚都拥有住址、债务和不肯交出的记忆。": "In the deleted versions of the city, every Noa holds an address, a debt and a memory she will not surrender.",
  "档案馆称未完成的街区不具备住户；住户们因此把门牌写在梦里。": "The archive says an unfinished quarter has no residents; the residents therefore write their house numbers in dreams.",
  "十二位旧诺亚是镜中残影，还是被城市排除的真实居民？": "Are the twelve old Noas afterimages in a mirror, or real residents the city excluded?",
