  "03:49 — 零号门为每一份签名保留独立出口。": "03:49 — The zero door keeps a separate exit for each signature.",
  "05:00 — 镜面失去裁决者，第一次只映出十三个人。": "05:00 — Without an arbiter, the mirror for the first time reflects only thirteen people.",
  "终灯会需要的从来不是第十三个祭品，而是一位愿意把复杂人生压成单一答案的观察者。十三张签名车票证明，每位诺亚都能独立说明自己的来路、关系与选择。公开可以摧毁终灯会的秘密，封存可以争取安全；但最完整的归还，是让每个人自己决定使用哪个名字、走哪一扇门，以及是否让白昼知道她曾经存在。事务所只应保存她们交出的决定，不应替她们完成决定。": "What the Afterlight Society needed was never a thirteenth sacrifice, but an observer willing to press a complex life into a single answer. Thirteen signed tickets prove that each Noa can account, on her own, for her provenance, relations and choices. Making it public can destroy the society's secret; sealing it can buy safety; but the fullest return is to let each person decide which name to use, which door to take, and whether daylight may know she ever existed. The agency should keep only the decisions they surrender, and never complete those decisions for them.",
  "当十三个人都能连续证明自己的生活时，调查者还有什么资格指定唯一原本？": "When thirteen people can each prove a continuous life, what right has the investigator to designate a single original?",
  "十二份合法入境章": "Twelve legal entry stamps",
