  "校方愿意承认摄影事故，不愿承认十三段校园生活，并建议先归入“重复旅客”临时卷宗。": "The school is willing to admit a photographic accident, but not thirteen school lives, and recommends filing it first under the 'repeat traveller' temporary dossier.",
