  "市政清洁处把纸结归类为未成年人乱丢的路标，并建议先归入“重复旅客”临时卷宗。": "The municipal cleaning office classes the knots as waymarks littered by minors, and recommends filing it first under the 'repeat traveller' temporary dossier.",
  "每一种折法都只可能来自真正走完那条路的人。": "Each folding could only come from someone who truly walked that route to its end.",
