  "掌灯时分，零号回程门把“未成线的十二个地址”叠成两层轻微错位的街景，每层窗口都有人回应。": "At lamplighting, the zero return door folds 'The Twelve Addresses of the Unmade Line' into two slightly misaligned streetscapes, and from the windows of each layer someone answers.",
