  "掌灯时分，夜班事务所归档桌把“拒绝唯一原本”叠成两层轻微错位的街景，每层窗口都有人回应。": "At lamplighting, the Night Shift Agency filing desk folds 'Refuse a Single Original' into two slightly misaligned streetscapes, and from the windows of each layer someone answers.",
